  "ruleText": "Med 610.01 Identification. A physician assistant shall keep his or her license available for inspection at the primary place of business and shall, when engaged in his or her professional activities, wear a name tag identifying themselves as a \"physician assistant\".\n\nSource. #6472, eff 3-25-97, EXPIRED: 3-25-05\n\nNew. #8678, eff 7-11-06, EXPIRED: 7-11-14\n\nNew. #10926, INTERIM, eff 9-4-15; ss by #11049, eff 3-2-16; ss by #13249, eff 8-6-21",
